#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:4
msgid "Display"
msgstr "展示"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:6
msgid ""
"All outstream ad formats supported by Origin SDK are renderable "
"using :code:`DisplayPlacementView`. By default, a :code:`DisplayPlacementView` "
"will automatically render ad media for any format which has been 1) enabled on "
"the |vendor_name| Origin Platform Console for the respective placement and, 2) "
"is supported by the device on which the SDK is executing. Certain ad formats, "
"such as interstitial, do require SDK configuration; however, most are enabled "
"and used by default whenever available."
msgstr ""
"Origin SDK 支持的所有外播广告格式均可通过 "
":code:`DisplayPlacementView` 进行渲染。默认情况下，"
":code:`DisplayPlacementView` 会自动渲染满足以下条件的广告媒体格式："
"1）已在 |vendor_name| Origin Platform Console 中针对对应广告位启用；"
"2）SDK 当前运行所在设备支持该广告格式。"
"某些广告格式（例如插屏广告）需要额外进行 SDK 配置；"
"但大多数广告格式在可用时均会默认启用并使用。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:13
msgid ""
"The size of display placement views is controlled, when not configured "
"explicitly, through the size constraints of the view when it undergoes the "
"`layout pass <layout_pass_>`_. When an ad is available for a display placement view, the view "
"will automatically attempt to resize itself, either shrinking or expanding, "
"based on the size constraints of the available ad."
msgstr ""
"当未进行显式配置时，展示广告位视图的大小由视图执行 "
"`布局阶段 <layout_pass_>`_ 时的尺寸约束决定。当某个广告可用于展示广告位视图时，"
"该视图会根据可用广告的尺寸约束，自动尝试调整自身大小，包括缩小或扩展。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:20
msgid ""
"When ad media is rendered by a display placement view, and the view, after a "
"subsequent layout pass, cannot meet the size constraints of the rendered ad "
"media, the ads module *will* attempt to replace the ad media with any other ad "
"media available which fits within the size constraints of the view. This is "
"done since ad media whose size constraints cannot be met, cannot be impressed. "
"In order to reduce revenue loss, replacing ad media is preferred whenever "
"possible, in such situations."
msgstr ""
"当广告媒体由展示广告位视图进行渲染，并且该视图在后续 "
"`布局阶段 <layout_pass_>`_ 后无法满足已渲染广告媒体的尺寸约束时，"
"广告模块将尝试使用其他满足该视图尺寸约束的可用广告媒体替换当前广告媒体。"
"这样做是因为无法满足尺寸约束的广告媒体无法产生曝光。"
"在这种情况下，为减少收入损失，只要条件允许，优先选择替换广告媒体。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:30
msgid "Lifecycle"
msgstr "生命周期"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:32
msgid ""
"Display placement views begin requesting ads whenever they are attached to a "
"display. For so long as a view is attached to a display, it will follow the "
"usual cycle of loading and reloading ads, based on the :ref:`ad rendering "
"schedule <integration_ads_scheduling>` for the placement the view renders ad "
"media for."
msgstr ""
"展示广告位视图在被添加到显示层级时，会开始请求广告。"
"只要该视图仍处于显示层级中，它就会根据该视图所渲染广告媒体对应广告位的 "
":ref:`广告渲染计划 <integration_ads_scheduling>`，"
"按照正常流程进行广告加载和重新加载。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:37
msgid ""
"Ads may be requested manually, using :code:`beginRequestingAds()`, however, the "
"view will *not* actually render any ad media until it is attached to a display. "
"Note, however, invoking :code:`beginRequestingAds()` before setting the "
"supported ad media size will result in an error being thrown. Additionally, as "
"soon as the view is detached from its display, ad requests will stop and must "
"be restarted either manually using :code:`beginRequestingAds()` *or* attaching "
"the view to a display."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 :code:`beginRequestingAds()` 手动请求广告，但是在该视图附加到展示区域之前，"
"视图*不会*实际渲染任何广告媒体。请注意，在设置支持的广告媒体尺寸之前调用 "
":code:`beginRequestingAds()` 将导致错误。此外，一旦视图从其展示区域中移除，广告请求"
"将停止，并且必须通过手动调用 :code:`beginRequestingAds()` *或* 将视图重新附加到展示"
"区域来重新启动广告请求。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:44
msgid "Manually requesting ads"
msgstr "手动请求广告"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:80
msgid "Sizing"
msgstr "尺寸设置"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:82
msgid ""
"Display placement views automatically determine their maximum supported ad "
"media size based on the measurement from its layout passes. Supported size "
"constraints can, however, be set explicitly "
"using :code:`setSupportedAdMediaSize()`. The final supported size is still "
"calculated based on measurements from layout passes, however, the explicitly "
"set supported size constraints are used as lower and upper limits for the final "
"measurements from layout passes."
msgstr ""
"展示广告位视图会根据布局测量阶段获取的尺寸信息，自动确定其支持的最大广告媒体尺寸。"
"不过，也可以通过 :code:`setSupportedAdMediaSize()` 显式设置支持的尺寸约束。最终支持"
"的尺寸仍然会根据布局测量阶段的结果计算，但显式设置的尺寸约束会作为最终测量结果的"
"下限和上限。"

