#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:211
msgid ""
"Modality may be enabled for display placement views to enable support for "
"interstitial, full screen expandable, rewarded, and splash ad formats."
msgstr ""
"可以为展示广告位视图启用模态模式，以支持插页式广告、全屏可扩展广告、激励广告以及"
"开屏广告等广告格式。"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:215
msgid "Full Screen Expandable"
msgstr "全屏可扩展广告"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:251 ../../integration/ads/index.rst:18
#: ../../integration/ads/placement.rst:28 ../../integration/ads/placement.rst:46
msgid "Interstitial"
msgstr "插页式广告"

#: ../../integration/ads/display.rst:299
msgid ""
"If rewarded ads are enabled, in the |vendor_name| Origin Platform Console, for "
"the interstitial placement, then rewarded ads *may* be shown within the "
"interstitial placement. In such cases, ensure the :code:`EVENT_USER_REWARD` "
"event is handled appropriately. To test whether a rewarded ad is rendered "
"within an interstitial placement, the :code:`AdInstance::isRewarded()` method "
"can be used."
msgstr ""
"如果在 |vendor_name| Origin 平台控制台中为插页式广告位启用了激励广告，则激励广告"
"*可能*会在该插页式广告位中展示。在这种情况下，请确保正确处理 "
":code:`EVENT_USER_REWARD` 事件。可以使用 :code:`AdInstance::isRewarded()` 方法"
"检测插页式广告位中当前渲染的广告是否为激励广告。"

