#: ../../integration/ads/events.rst:6
msgid ""
"Advertising events are generated on a per-placement basis. These events can be "
"listened for using a specific placement renderer, or across all placements "
"which have a renderer active. The :code:`PlacementEvent` class is used to "
"describe each event."
