#: ../../integration/ads/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"The ads module is responsible for maintaining active list of placements, "
"requesting ads for placements, scheduling rendering of ads within placements, "
"and managing events associated with placements. The ads module itself does not "
"render ads, instead the module provides two types of placement renderers, which "
"are used to drive the advertising flow within an application."
msgstr ""
"广告模块负责维护当前启用的广告位列表、为广告位请求广告、调度广告在广告位中的渲染，"
"以及管理与广告位相关的事件。广告模块本身不负责渲染广告，而是提供两种类型的广告位"
"渲染器，用于驱动应用程序中的广告展示流程。"


