#: ../../integration/ads/placement.rst:52
msgid ""
"The ads module of the Origin SDK exports only placement renderers. Placement "
"renderers are integrated within an application. The combination of rendering "
"constraints and placement constraints defined in the |vendor_name| Origin "
"Platform Console define the full placement constraints for the respective "
"placement instance on the user's device. This simplifies the rendering, "
"integration, and placement management pipeline, as a majority of placement "
"constraints can be updated remotely, without requiring an application-side "
"update."
msgstr ""
"Origin SDK 的广告模块仅提供广告位渲染器。广告位渲染器需要集成到应用程序中。"
"|vendor_name| Origin 平台控制台中定义的渲染约束和广告位约束共同决定了用户设备"
"上对应广告位实例的完整约束配置。这样可以简化广告渲染、集成以及广告位管理流程，"
"因为大部分广告位约束都可以通过远程方式更新，而无需更新应用程序端代码。"

#: ../../integration/ads/placement.rst:59
msgid "Placement Flow"
msgstr "广告位流程"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:6
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "调度"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ads module supports preloading and caching ads on a per-placement basis. As "
"such, at any given point in time, there may be multiple ads available for a "
"placement, even across application restarts, without making a network request. "
"In order to facilitate selecting between multiple different possible cached "
"ads, the ads module maintains a schedule for when cached ads will be rendered."
msgstr ""
"广告模块支持基于广告位进行广告预加载和缓存。因此，在任意时间点，即使应用程序重新"
"启动后，某个广告位仍可能存在多个可用广告，而无需重新发起网络请求。为了便于从多个"
"可能的缓存广告中进行选择，广告模块会维护缓存广告的渲染调度策略。"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:13
msgid ""
"Ads returned by |vendor_name| Origin Platform, for a placement, specify three "
"necessary fields which are used when scheduling ads: price :math:`p`, minimum "
"exposure duration :math:`d`, and expiration timestamp :math:`t`. The price of "
"an ad is the price, in cost-per-milli (CPM) or CPM per second (for playback "
"media), the buyer is willing to pay for the ad to be rendered. The minimum "
"exposure duration and expiration timestamp define the minimum duration the ad "
"must be rendered for and the timestamp after which the buyer will not consider "
"any ad impression billable, respectively. When scheduling a set of "
"ads :math:`A`, then, the algorithm is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"|vendor_name| Origin Platform 针对广告位返回的广告包含三个用于广告调度的必要字段："
"价格 :math:`p`、最小曝光时长 :math:`d` 以及过期时间戳 :math:`t`。广告价格指买方"
"愿意为广告完成渲染所支付的价格，单位为千次展示成本（CPM），对于播放类媒体则为"
"每秒 CPM。最小曝光时长和过期时间戳分别定义了广告必须持续渲染的最短时间，以及超过"
"该时间戳后买方不再认为该广告曝光可计费的时间点。对于一组广告 :math:`A` 进行调度时，"
"算法如下："

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:21
msgid "For every ad :math:`A_i`, sort by :math:`\\alpha = t - d`."
msgstr "对于每个广告 :math:`A_i`，按照 :math:`\\alpha = t - d` 进行排序。"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:22
msgid ""
"Any :math:`A_i` whose :math:`\\alpha` is less or equal to :math:`0` is removed."
msgstr ""
"移除所有满足 :math:`\\alpha \\leq 0` 的广告 :math:`A_i`。"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:23
msgid ""
"Any :math:`A_i` whose immediate preceeding or succeeding ad has "
"an :math:`\\alpha` equal to the :math:`\\alpha` of :math:`A_i` are sorted "
"by :math:`p`, in decending order."
msgstr ""
"如果广告 :math:`A_i` 的前一个或后一个广告具有与 :math:`A_i` 相同的 "
":math:`\\alpha` 值，则这些广告按照价格 :math:`p` 降序排序。"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:25
msgid ""
"Begin preloading :math:`A_i` when its scheduled placement renderer is not "
"currently rendering any ad media *or* the media currently rendered within the "
"placement has reached :math:`80\\%` of its minimum exposure duration :math:`d`."
msgstr ""
"当其对应的广告位渲染器当前未渲染任何广告媒体，或者当前广告媒体的展示时间已经达到"
"其最小曝光时长 :math:`d` 的 :math:`80\\%` 时，开始预加载广告 :math:`A_i`。"

#: ../../integration/ads/scheduling.rst:29
msgid ""
"Through this, ad media is served as quickly as possible, without waiting on any "
"delays introduced by the network connection of the device. In addition, certain "
"placement renderers, such as :code:`DisplayPlacementView` permit rendering "
"multiple different ads at the same time. Through this the effective ad request "
"count remains stable, while the impression fill rate should remain close to the "
"theoretical fill rate given demand for the respective placement."
msgstr ""
"通过这种方式，广告媒体可以尽可能快速地展示，而无需等待设备网络连接造成的延迟。"
"此外，某些广告位渲染器（例如 :code:`DisplayPlacementView`）支持同时渲染多个不同"
"广告。这样可以保持有效广告请求数量稳定，同时广告曝光填充率应保持接近在对应广告位"
"需求情况下的理论填充率。"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:4 ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:224
msgid "Antifraud"
msgstr "反欺诈"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:6
msgid ""
"The antifraud module is responsible for protecting applications against invalid "
"traffict (IVT), as defined by the `MRC Invalid Traffic Standards`_. This "
"includes, but is not limited to, both device and application integrity."
msgstr ""
"反欺诈模块负责根据 `MRC Invalid Traffic Standards`_ 的定义，保护应用程序免受无效"
"流量（IVT）的影响。其中包括但不限于设备完整性和应用程序完整性检测。"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:10
msgid ""
"Security tests are performed, by the antifraud module, on both the device and "
"the application. The result of these security tests is forwarded to an "
"attestation server. The attestation server evaluates the security test results "
"and produces a *signed* verdict digest. This signed verdict digest can then "
"used by remote backend processes to 1) verify the antifraud verdict and 2) "
"verify the antifraud verdict signature."
msgstr ""
"反欺诈模块会分别对设备和应用程序执行安全检测。这些安全检测结果会被发送至远程证明"
"服务器。远程证明服务器会评估安全检测结果，并生成一个*签名的*判定摘要。该签名判定"
"摘要随后可由远程后端服务用于：1）验证反欺诈判定结果；2）验证反欺诈判定结果的签名。"


#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:16
msgid "Antifraud Architecture"
msgstr "反欺诈架构"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:60
msgid ""
"With this attestation based architecture, the remote backend processes, which "
"may be serving ads, performing monitoring, or performing some expensive "
"operation, can validate any request it receives from the device are not "
"fraudulent. If a request is fraudulent, then it may skip any expensive "
"processing, or monetary processing."
msgstr ""
"通过这种基于远程证明的架构，负责广告服务、监控或执行高成本操作的远程后端服务，"
"可以验证其从设备接收到的请求是否存在欺诈行为。如果请求被判定为欺诈请求，则可以"
"跳过高成本处理或涉及资金的处理流程。"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:66
msgid "Accessing Security Verdict"
msgstr "访问安全判定结果"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:68
msgid ""
"Through the SDK, the antifraud module can be used to retrieve the signed "
"security verdict, along with fraud rating and confidence. The signed verdict "
"may be used by application backend servers to ensure a device is valid before "
"processing its request, or restrict services to the device. The fraud rating "
"and confidence can be used on the device, by application code, to determine "
"whether functionality should be locally restricted."
msgstr ""
"通过 SDK，反欺诈模块可以获取签名的安全判定结果，以及欺诈等级和置信度。应用程序"
"后端服务器可以使用该签名判定结果，在处理设备请求之前验证设备是否有效，或限制该"
"设备访问相关服务。应用程序代码也可以在设备端使用欺诈等级和置信度，判断是否需要"
"在本地限制部分功能。"

#: ../../integration/antifraud.rst:74
msgid ""
"As these verdicts are expensive to compute on attestation servers, they are "
"provided lazily through the SDK's event bus."
msgstr ""
"由于这些判定结果在远程证明服务器上的计算成本较高，因此 SDK 会通过事件总线以"
"延迟方式提供这些结果。"

#: ../../integration/index.rst:5
msgid "Integration"
msgstr "集成"

#: ../../integration/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"Origin Android SDK interacts with the |vendor_name| Origin Platform, allowing "
"developers to monetize, monitor, and protect applications for the Android "
"platform. The SDK is designed to be simple and easy to implement, with a focus "
"on performance and low footprint."
msgstr ""
"Origin Android SDK 与 |vendor_name| Origin Platform 进行交互，使开发者能够针对"
"Android 平台应用实现变现、监控和保护。该 SDK 设计简洁、易于集成，并注重性能和"
"低资源占用。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:4
msgid "Initializing"
msgstr "初始化"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Origin SDK is organized into 3 modules, *antifraud*, *ads*, and *monitor* "
"for device validation, monetization, and monitoring, respectively. During "
"initialization, one or more of these modules can be loaded. If a module is not "
"loaded during initialization, its capability is disabled. Additionally, with "
"compile-time optimizations, its likely that the code for the respective unused "
"modules will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Origin SDK 由三个模块组成，分别为 *antifraud*、*ads* 和 *monitor*，分别用于"
"设备验证、应用变现和监控。在初始化过程中，可以加载其中一个或多个模块。如果某个"
"模块未在初始化阶段加载，则该模块对应的能力将被禁用。此外，通过编译时优化，未使用"
"模块对应的代码可能会被移除。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:12
msgid ""
"Before any module can be used, the SDK must be initialized "
"using :code:`Origin::initialize()`. This method must be invoked within the main "
"application thread. It should be invoked only once. If it is invoked more than "
"once with different capabilities, the union of capabilities for all invocations "
"is what will be available."
msgstr ""
"在使用任何模块之前，必须通过 :code:`Origin::initialize()` 初始化 SDK。该方法"
"必须在应用程序主线程中调用，并且只应调用一次。如果使用不同能力参数多次调用"
"该方法，则所有调用所请求能力的并集将作为最后一次初始化时的可用能力。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:19
msgid ""
"The :code:`Origin::initialize()` method returns quickly. It primarily setups "
"base structures required by the SDK. Module logic is initialized in the "
"background."
msgstr ""
":code:`Origin::initialize()` 方法会快速返回。该方法主要用于初始化 SDK 所需的"
"基础结构，而模块逻辑会在后台完成初始化。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:22
msgid ""
"The SDK may be initialized early during application startup, within the "
"application entry-point, or if the main and user-interface (UI) threads of the "
"application are the same, within an activity of the application."
msgstr ""
"SDK 可以在应用启动早期阶段、应用程序入口点中完成初始化；如果应用程序主线程与"
"用户界面（UI）线程相同，也可以在应用程序的某个 Activity 中进行初始化。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:26
msgid "Initializing within application entry-point."
msgstr "在应用程序入口中初始化。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:53
msgid "Initialize within an activity."
msgstr "在 Activity 中初始化。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:81
msgid ""
"To initialize all modules implicitly, :code:`Origin::initialize()` may be "
"invoked with only the application "
"context, :code:`Origin.initialize(appContext)`."
msgstr ""
"要隐式初始化所有模块，可以仅传入应用程序上下文调用 "
":code:`Origin::initialize()`，即 :code:`Origin.initialize(appContext)`。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:85
msgid "Device Id"
msgstr "设备标识符"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:87
msgid ""
"Device id is usually preferred by each capability the SDK is initialized with. "
"There are three possible identifier initialization methods supported, depending "
"on region and availability. See the sections below for description of each "
"method."
msgstr ""
"SDK 初始化时启用的每项能力通常都会优先使用设备标识符。根据地区和可用情况，SDK"
"支持三种设备标识符初始化方式。有关每种方式的说明，请参阅以下章节。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:92
msgid "Google Advertising Identifier"
msgstr "Google 广告标识符"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:94
msgid ""
"If the application is executing on a device with Google Mobile Services (GMS), "
"and an advertising identifier is sanctioned, then the Google Advertising "
"Identifier (GAID) is used automatically."
msgstr ""
"如果应用程序运行在支持 Google Mobile Services（GMS）的设备上，并且广告标识符"
"访问权限可用，则会自动使用 Google 广告标识符（GAID）。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:99
msgid ""
"If GAID is not :ref:`configured <integration_prereq_gaid>`, GAID will *not* be "
"available at all."
msgstr ""
"如果 GAID 未按照 :ref:`配置要求 <integration_prereq_gaid>` 完成配置，则 GAID "
"*完全不可用*。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:102 ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:234
msgid "Open Anonymous Device Identifier"
msgstr "开放匿名设备标识符"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:104
msgid ""
"If the application is executing on a device which supports Open Anonymous "
"Device Identifier (OAID), and an OAID is available, then the OAID is used "
"automatically. Any application targeting the China market will always use the "
"OAID."
msgstr ""
"如果应用程序运行在支持开放匿名设备标识符（OAID）的设备上，并且 OAID 可用，则"
"会自动使用 OAID。任何面向中国市场的应用程序都会始终使用 OAID。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:110
msgid ""
"If OAID is not :ref:`configured <integration_prereq_oaid>`, OAID will *not* be "
"available at all."
msgstr ""
"如果 OAID 未按照 :ref:`配置要求 <integration_prereq_oaid>` 完成配置，则 OAID "
"*完全不可用*。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:113
msgid "Custom Identifier"
msgstr "自定义标识符"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:115
msgid ""
"When the application executes on a device which does not support any of the "
"standard device identifiers, a custom identifier may be supplied during SDK "
"initialization using the :code:`Origin::initializeWithOptions()` method."
msgstr ""
"当应用程序运行在不支持任何标准设备标识符的设备上时，可以在 SDK 初始化过程中通过 "
":code:`Origin::initializeWithOptions()` 方法提供自定义标识符。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:151
msgid ""
"Replace :code:`DEVICE_ID_TYPE` and :code:`DEVICE_ID` with the device identifier "
"type and device identifier value, respectively. The identifier type should be a "
"unique type name of the identifier type. For example, the identifier type of "
"Google Advertiser Identifier is :code:`\"gaid\"`."
msgstr ""
"将 :code:`DEVICE_ID_TYPE` 和 :code:`DEVICE_ID` 分别替换为设备标识符类型和设备"
"标识符值。标识符类型应为该标识符类型对应的唯一名称。例如，Google 广告标识符的"
"标识符类型为 :code:`\"gaid\"`。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:155
msgid ""
"Two types of custom identifiers are supported, *dynamic* and *static*, "
"specified using :code:`addDynamicDeviceId` and :code:`addStaticDeviceId`, "
"respectively. Dynamic device identifiers may change during the lifecycle of an "
"application execution, and are provided using a provider function, which is "
"invoked, on a worker thread, with the application context. Static device "
"identifiers, however, do not change during the lifecycle of an application "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"支持两种类型的自定义标识符：*动态标识符* 和 *静态标识符*，分别通过 "
":code:`addDynamicDeviceId` 和 :code:`addStaticDeviceId` 指定。动态设备标识符"
"可能会在应用程序运行生命周期内发生变化，并通过提供者函数提供。该函数会在工作"
"线程中调用，并接收应用程序上下文作为参数。而静态设备标识符在应用程序运行生命"
"周期内不会发生变化。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:163
msgid ""
"Multiple custom device identifiers may be specified by "
"invoking :code:`addDynamicDeviceId` or :code:`addStaticDeviceId` more than once."
msgstr ""
"可以通过多次调用 :code:`addDynamicDeviceId` 或 :code:`addStaticDeviceId` "
"指定多个自定义设备标识符。"

#: ../../integration/initializing.rst:168
msgid ""
"When providing custom device identifiers, ensure the identifiers do have some "
"form of stability. In other words, an identifier which changes each time the "
"application is restarted will likely result in poor performance."
msgstr ""
"提供自定义设备标识符时，请确保这些标识符具有一定的稳定性。换句话说，如果某个"
"标识符在每次应用程序重新启动时都会发生变化，可能会导致较差的性能表现。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:4
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:6
msgid "Before integrating, the following steps must be performed."
msgstr "在进行集成之前，必须完成以下步骤。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:9
msgid "Android API Level"
msgstr "Android API Level"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:11
msgid ""
"Ensure :code:`minSdk` and :code:`targetSdk` is :code:`19` or higher, "
"and, :code:`35` or higher, respectively."
msgstr ""
"确保 :code:`minSdk` 和 :code:`targetSdk` 分别为 :code:`19` 及以上和 "
":code:`35` 及以上。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:33
msgid "Configuring Project"
msgstr "项目配置"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:35
msgid "Include the `Maven central repository`_ within your Gradle settings."
msgstr "在 Gradle 设置中添加 `Maven Central 仓库 <Maven central repository_>`_。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:61
msgid "Add the dependency for |vendor_name| Origin SDK to your Gradle build file."
msgstr "将 |vendor_name| Origin SDK 的依赖添加到 Gradle 构建文件中。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:74
msgid ""
"We use a version range as minor versions are guaranteed to be backwards "
"compatible. Using a version range here ensures any new feature, bug fixes, or "
"new platform support can be included automatically. If a fixed version is "
"preferred, then the version range can be replaced with |version_current|."
msgstr ""
"我们使用版本范围，因为小版本号版本保证向后兼容。使用版本范围可以确保自动包含"
"新的功能、错误修复以及新的平台支持。如果希望使用固定版本，则可以将版本范围替换"
"为 |version_current|。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:81
msgid ""
"When including the Origin SDK as a dependency from a precompiled AAR, the Maven "
"coordinates above may be ignored, instead the AAR flat-file can be included "
"directly, with the following additional dependencies."
msgstr ""
"当通过预编译 AAR 方式将 Origin SDK 作为依赖引入时，可以忽略上述 Maven 坐标，"
"而直接添加 AAR 文件，同时添加以下额外依赖。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:100
msgid "`Synchronize Gradle changes`_ by clicking **Sync Now**."
msgstr "点击 **Sync Now** 执行 `同步 Gradle 更改 <Synchronize Gradle changes_>`_。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:104
msgid "Update the application manifest as required."
msgstr "根据需要更新Application Manifest文件。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:124
msgid ""
"Replace :code:`ORIGIN-APPLICATION-ID` or :code:`ORIGIN-PUBLISHER-ID` with the "
"distribution channel or publisher id allocated through the |vendor_name| Origin "
"Platform. During testing and development, the special id :code:`test` can be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"将 :code:`ORIGIN-APPLICATION-ID` 或 :code:`ORIGIN-PUBLISHER-ID` 替换为通过 "
"|vendor_name| Origin Platform 分配的分发渠道 ID 或发布者 ID。在测试和开发阶段，"
"可以使用特殊 ID :code:`test`。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:130
msgid ""
"Only one of :code:`application-id` or :code:`publisher-id` meta-data entry is "
"required. When :code:`publisher-id` is set, the combination of :code:`publisher-"
"id` and application bundle is used to identify the application. "
"Using :code:`application-id` should be preferred wherever possible."
msgstr ""
"只需要配置 :code:`application-id` 或 :code:`publisher-id` 其中一个元数据项。"
"当设置 :code:`publisher-id` 时，将使用 :code:`publisher-id` 与应用包的组合作为"
"应用程序身份标识。在可能的情况下，应优先使用 :code:`application-id`。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:137
msgid ""
"When integrating the Origin SDK for only ads, :code:`application-id` "
"and :code:`publisher-id` are optional as placement ids are used to identify the "
"application. Even so, specifying at least one should be preferred in order to "
"ensure integration failures are recognized by the |vendor_name| Origin Platform."
msgstr ""
"当仅为广告功能集成 Origin SDK 时，:code:`application-id` 和 "
":code:`publisher-id` 是可选的，因为 placement id 会用于标识应用程序。"
"即便如此，仍建议至少指定其中一个，以确保集成失败能够被 |vendor_name| Origin "
"Platform 识别。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:143
