msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:236
msgid ""
"Android Open Anonymous Device Identifier (OAID) is a user-resettable unique "
"identifier for Android devices, introduced by the Mobile Security Alliance "
"(MSA) and China Information and Communication Research Institute. OAID is "
"supported by the Origin SDK, and should be used when the application is "
"targeting the Chinese market, as OAID is the primary id sanctioned for "
"advertising within China."
msgstr ""
"Android 开放匿名设备标识符（OAID）是由移动安全联盟（MSA）和中国信息通信研究院"
"推出的一种适用于 Android 设备的用户可重置唯一标识符。Origin SDK 支持 OAID，"
"当应用程序面向中国市场时，应使用 OAID，因为 OAID 是中国广告场景中主要认可的"
"设备标识符。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:243
msgid ""
"These instructions assume shell commands are executed from the directory the "
"MSA SDK and artifacts are unzipped in. Replace :code:`/<path>/<to>/<project>` "
"with the path to the application project."
msgstr ""
"以下说明假设 shell 命令在 MSA SDK 及相关文件解压后的目录中执行。请将 "
":code:`/<path>/<to>/<project>` 替换为应用程序项目所在路径。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:246
msgid "Get MSA SDK from `Mobile Security Alliance`_."
msgstr "从 `移动安全联盟(MSA) <Mobile Security Alliance_>`_ 获取 MSA SDK。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:248
msgid "Copy MSA SDK AAR flat-file into a local folder."
msgstr "将 MSA SDK 的 AAR 文件复制到本地文件夹中。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:254
msgid ""
"Copy :code:`supplierconfig.json` into the :code:`assets` folder of the "
"application project."
msgstr ""
"将 :code:`supplierconfig.json` 复制到应用程序项目的 :code:`assets` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:260
msgid ""
"Copy :code:`<app-bundle>.cert.pem` into the :code:`assets` folder of the "
"application project."
msgstr ""
"将 :code:`<app-bundle>.cert.pem` 复制到应用程序项目的 :code:`assets` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:266
msgid "Add the dependency for MSA SDK to your Gradle build file."
msgstr "将 MSA SDK 依赖添加到 Gradle 构建文件中。"

#: ../../integration/prerequisites.rst:290
msgid "Update Proguard release rules."
msgstr "更新 ProGuard 发布规则。"
